  "details": "Ability to attach a grabbable object to a physical tracker.\n\nCould be a prop, camera or any grabbable item in a world.\n\nFor example if you laser over it with the menu, the option could be there to bind it to a physical tracker, so you could move it around by moving the tracker.\n\nThere already are tools to do this with objects on-avatar but being able to do it with any prop would be nice and elegant.",
